{s:OUT,k:'outro',term:'Outro',say:`So remember: dry oxide for the gate, the junction lies deeper than one diffusion length, and a wet etch undercuts. Next time, ${P('NMOS')} and ${P('CMOS')} fabrication process flow. See you there!`,cues:{f:'So remember',w1:'dry oxide for',w2:'the junction lies',w3:'and a wet etch',n:'Next time',s:'See you there'},words:[['DRY OXIDE FOR THE GATE','BLU','w1'],['JUNCTION DEEPER THAN L','ORG','w2'],['WET ETCH UNDERCUTS','GRN','w3']],next:["NEXT TIME", "Next lesson", "NMOS and CMOS fabrication process flow", "book"],end:'See you there!'}
